  "descriptionHtml": "<p>Our Carter mini sling is the crossbody bag built for a long day on your feet—theme parks, late nights, and everything in between. Made from recycled nylon with a zip top, the sling silhouette keeps things hands-free without the bulk. A small bag for a very big day.</p>\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin-top: 1.5rem;\">\n<h4 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\">Specifications & Details</h4>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: none; padding-left: 0; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.6;\">\n<li><strong>Material:</strong> 100% recycled nylon</li>\n<li><strong>Lining:</strong> Fabric lining</li>\n<li><strong>Hardware:</strong> Gold hardware (deep cherry, hot fudge); silver hardware (black, pale hydrangea)</li>\n<li><strong>Shoulder Strap Drop:</strong> Adjustable crossbody strap with 22&quot; drop</li>\n<li><strong>Pockets:</strong> Interior: 3 credit card slots</li>\n<li><strong>Closure:</strong> Zip closure</li>\n<li><strong>Bag Dimensions:</strong> 10.2&quot; (L) x 6&quot; (H) x 3.4&quot; (W)</li>\n</ul>\n</div>",
